From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:39:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ScreenshotSurfaceAML: blend captured video under the GUI

The GLES readback holds only the GUI, so an Amlogic screenshot during
playback shows no video, and under an HDR GUI it is PQ coded while it is
tagged SDR. Overlay art above GUI white clips per channel, which turns
a blue menu panel cyan.
